   "status": "not fixed",
   "effect_on_zc2": "none observed"
  },
  {
   "id": "C1",
   "kind": "confound",
   "severity": "high",
   "title": "dynamic differs from independent by far more than messages: host-maintained team_board (active peer claims = intents, finished/stopped reports), host arbitration of claims against peer claims, conflict notices, event wake-ups, plus broadcast messages",
   "evidence": [
    "scripts/run_zone_dispatch.py:188-190",
    "scripts/run_zone_dispatch.py:366-402",
    "harness/zone_coordination.py:159-227",
    "scripts/three_robot_runtime.py:164-172 (messages to every robot)",
    "ZC2 dynamic: 1 collision, 0 invalid claims; reasons cite peers' current jobs (present in both board and messages); s14 recovery cites a message"
   ],
   "status": "not fixed (design); proposed ablations dynamic_board_only / dynamic_messages_only",
   "effect_on_zc2": "ZC2 measures the coordination bundle, not explicit LLM messages alone"
  },
  {
   "id": "C2",
   "kind": "confound",
   "severity": "medium",
   "title": "prompt scaffolding differs beyond the channel: dynamic gets an explicit id tie-break convention and \"avoid peers' current paths\"; independent gets no no-communication convention although its own fixture uses one (robot i takes the i-th need unit); plan_first gets a proposer protocol and \"balance the work\"",
   "evidence": [
    "harness/zone_coordination.py:34-50 (_PLAN)",
    "harness/zone_coordination.py:52-66 (_CLAIM)",
    "harness/zone_solo.py:18-28 (_SOLO)",
    "harness/zone_solo.py:96-112 (fixture convention)",
    "shared prefix _COMMON identical: harness/zone_coordination.py:23-32"
   ],
   "status": "not fixed",
   "effect_on_zc2": "tie-break fired in at most 1 ZC2 collision, so it cannot explain the 6/6 vs 1/6 gap; a no-communication convention for independent was never tried"
  },
  {
   "id": "C3",
   "kind": "confound",
   "severity": "medium (time/cost), low (success)",
   "title": "different wake/re-ask rules: independent polls every 10 SIM s after null/invalid/own stop; dynamic wakes idle robots when any job ends and re-asks a stalled team up to 2x; plan_first never re-asks",
   "evidence": [
